NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_1::
	.string "{PLAYER}, do it!\p"
	.string "I’m behind you all the way!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_2::
	.string "Wow, that’s a cute POKéMON.\n"
	.string "Where did you get it?\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "So, you’re leaving on an adventure...\p"
	.string "OK!\n"
	.string "I’ll help too.\p"
	.string "But what can I do for you?\p"
	.string "I know!\n"
	.string "On a long journey, money’s important.\p"
	.string "That’s why I’ll give you this!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_3::
	.string "MOM: {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You should take a quick rest.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_4::
	.string "MOM: Oh, good! You and your\n"
	.string "POKéMON are looking great.\l"
	.string "Take care now!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_5::
	.string "So, what was PROF.ELM’s errand?\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "That does sound challenging.\n"
	.string "But, you should be proud that\l"
	.string "people rely on you.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_6::
	.string "MOM: PROF.ELM is waiting for you.\p"
	.string "Hurry up, baby!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_7::
	.string "MOM: PROF.ELM is waiting for you.\p"
	.string "Hurry up, baby!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Mom_8::
	.string "Wait, honey!\p"
	.string "Since you’ll travel a lot, I think you\n"
	.string "should put your RUNNING SHOES on.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Oh, {PLAYER}...! Our neighbor, PROF.\n"
	.string "ELM, was looking for you.\p"
	.string "He said he wanted you to do\n"
	.string "something for him.\p"
	.string "Oh! I almost forgot!\n"
	.string "Since you are going to be out for\l"
	.string "a while, I think you should get\l"
	.string "this.\p"
	.string "Here you go!$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "Those items are essential if you\n"
	.string "want to be a good trainer.\p"
	.string "By the way, do you remember what\n"
	.string "those two items do?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "That’s right. The PHONE CARD is\n"
	.string "used on telephones, and it can\l"
	.string "only store up to ten numbers.\p"
	.string "I’m already registered, sweetie.\n"
	.string "That makes it nine, then.\p"
	.string "And the BEEPER is for when people\n"
	.string "wants to send you a message\l"
	.string "anytime.\p"
	.string "Gee, isn’t that convenient?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "I’ll remind it to you, then.\p"
	.string "Use that PHONE CARD on any telephone\n"
	.string "you find.\p"
	.string "You can only call those phones\n"
	.string "registered on the card’s memory.\p"
	.string "It can only store up to ten\n"
	.string "phone numbers.\p"
	.string "I’m already registered, sweetie.\n"
	.string "That makes it nine, then.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "Now, about the POKéBEEPER.\p"
	.string "This little gadget can receive\n"
	.string "messages from people who knows its\l"
	.string "number.\p"
	.string "So, pay attention to it, honey.\n"
	.string "It’ll make a strong beep when you\l"
	.string "get a message.\p"
	.string "Aren’t these little artifacts useful?$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Sign_1::
	.string "Oops, wrong side…$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Sign_2::
	.string "There’s a movie on TV.\n"
	.string "Four boys are walking on railroad\l"
	.string "tracks.\p"
	.string "…I better go, too.$"

NewBarkTown_Interior1_Text_Sign_3::
	.string "There’s a movie on TV.\n"
	.string "A girl with her hair in pigtails is\l"
	.string "walking up a brick road.\p"
	.string "…I better go, too.$"
